---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ThemeToggle from "@/components/ThemeToggle.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="knowledge — documentation to linked Markdown"
  description="An alpha Python SDK that extracts heading-level concepts from URLs and local HTML or Markdown files into linked Markdown bundles."
>
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="site-nav">
        <a class="wordmark" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} aria-label="knowledge home">
          <span class="wordmark-mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span>
          <span>knowledge</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/`}>Documentation</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
          <a href="#quick-start">Quick start</a>
          <a href="#status">Status</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/sachncs/knowledge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <ThemeToggle />
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main" class="page-content">
      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p class="release-label"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> ALPHA RELEASE <span class="release-divider">/</span> v0.1.0</p>
          <h1 id="page-title">Turn documentation into linked Markdown.</h1>
          <p class="lede"><strong>knowledge</strong> reads a URL or local HTML/Markdown file, splits it by headings, and asks a selected language model to extract one concept per section. The result is a directory of Markdown files you can read, review, and version in Git.</p>
          <div class="intro-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#quick-start">Quick start <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/sachncs/knowledge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="requirements">Python 3.12+ <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> MIT license <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Configure an LLM provider</p>
        </div>

        <aside class="output-card" aria-label="Example command and bundle structure">
          <div class="card-heading"><span>Example</span><span>CLI</span></div>
          <pre class="command"><code>knowledge create \
  https://example.com/docs.html \
  ./docs-bundle</code></pre>
          <div class="tree-heading">Typical bundle shape</div>
          <pre class="file-tree"><code>docs-bundle/
├── index.md
└── &lt;concept-id&gt;.md</code></pre>
          <p class="card-note">Tag-based folders can be configured with a path map. The exact files depend on the source document.</p>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="details-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="kicker">THE BASICS</p>
          <h2 id="how-title">A small pipeline with readable output.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h3>Choose a source</h3><p>Pass a URL, or a local HTML or Markdown file. URL fetching has a 50 MiB body limit.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h3>Extract by heading</h3><p>HTML headings from h2 to h4 and Markdown h2 sections become separate extraction requests.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h3>Review the bundle</h3><p>The selected model returns structured concepts. The SDK writes Markdown with YAML metadata and validates index links.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="quickstart-section" id="quick-start" aria-labelledby="quick-title">
        <div class="quickstart-copy">
          <p class="kicker">GETTING STARTED</p>
          <h2 id="quick-title">Install, configure, run.</h2>
          <p>Install the package, set credentials for your chosen hosted provider, then point the CLI at a document. The default model is <code>gpt-4o</code> and requires <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code>; the guide covers other providers and the Python API.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/getting-started/`}>Read installation instructions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-card" aria-label="Installation commands">
          <p><span class="prompt">$</span> pip install knowledge</p>
          <p class="terminal-gap"><span class="prompt">$</span> knowledge create https://example.com/docs.html ./docs-bundle</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="notes-section" id="status" aria-labelledby="status-title">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">PROJECT STATUS</p>
          <h2 id="status-title">This is an alpha release.</h2>
          <p>The package is classified as Alpha. APIs and the bundle format may change; review the changelog and open issues before depending on it in a production workflow.</p>
          <div class="note-links">
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/changelog/`}>Changelog ↗</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/sachncs/knowledge/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open issues ↗</a>
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/`}>Documentation ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="data-note">
          <h3>Where document text goes</h3>
          <p>With a hosted model, extracted section text is sent to the provider you configure. When you run a model such as Ollama or vLLM locally, model requests can stay on your machine. Fetching a remote URL still requires network access.</p>
          <p class="data-caution">Updating a bundle replaces generated Markdown files. Keep a copy of any manual edits before updating.</p>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <span>knowledge · v0.1.0 · MIT</span>
      <div><a href="https://github.com/sachncs/knowledge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://pypi.org/project/knowledge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PyPI</a><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/roadmap/`}>Roadmap</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .site-shell {
    --paper: #f5f4f0;
    --paper-raised: #fbfaf7;
    --ink: #1d2529;
    --muted: #596467;
    --faint: #778184;
    --line: #d8d9d3;
    --accent: #3d5c7b;
    --accent-strong: #2d4966;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .site-shell {
    --paper: #151a1d;
    --paper-raised: #1c2326;
    --ink: #edf0ec;
    --muted: #b1bbb9;
    --faint: #899592;
    --line: #343e41;
    --accent: #a7bed4;
    --accent-strong: #c4d6e5;
  }

  .site-header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .site-nav, .page-content, .site-footer { width: min(100% - 48px, 1080px); margin-inline: auto; }
  .site-nav { min-height: 72px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 36px; }
  .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -0.03em; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark-mark { display: grid; width: 30px; height: 30px; place-items: center; background: var(--accent-strong); color: var(--paper-raised); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 750; }
  .site-nav nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-left: auto; }
  .site-nav nav a, .text-link, .site-footer a, .note-links a { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
  .site-nav nav a:hover, .text-link:hover, .site-footer a:hover, .note-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
  .page-content { padding-block: 72px 88px; }
  .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(300px, .85fr); align-items: center; gap: 64px; padding-bottom: 76px; }
  .release-label, .kicker { margin: 0; color: var(--faint); font: 600 11px/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .release-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .status-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #bb8a4b; }
  .release-divider { color: var(--line); }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
  h1 { max-width: 630px; margin: 22px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(42px, 5.5vw, 66px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 620; }
  .lede { max-width: 610px; margin-bottom: 26px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .lede strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; }
  .intro-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 42px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .button-primary { border-color: var(--accent-strong); background: var(--accent-strong); color: var(--paper-raised); }
  .button-primary:hover { opacity: .9; }
  .button-secondary:hover { background: var(--paper-raised); }
  .requirements { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--faint); font: 11px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .output-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper-raised); }
  .card-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 13px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font: 11px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  pre { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0; white-space: pre; }
  .command, .file-tree { padding: 18px 16px; color: var(--ink); font: 12px/1.8 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .command { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tree-heading { padding: 16px 16px 0; color: var(--faint); font: 10px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .file-tree { padding-top: 8px; }
  .card-note { margin: 0; padding: 0 16px 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .details-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 72px; padding-block: 46px 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .section-heading h2, .quickstart-copy h2, .notes-section h2 { max-width: 390px; margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px); line-height: 1.13; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-weight: 610; }
  .steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0 0 23px; }
  .steps li + li { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .step-number { color: var(--faint); font: 11px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .steps h3, .data-note h3 { margin: -3px 0 5px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 650; }
  .steps p, .quickstart-copy > p:not(.kicker), .notes-section > div > p:not(.kicker), .data-note p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .quickstart-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; align-items: center; gap: 72px; padding-block: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .quickstart-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 13px; }
  .quickstart-copy > p:not(.kicker) { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .text-link { display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .terminal-card { padding: 20px; background: #20282d; color: #e6e9e6; font: 12px/1.8 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .terminal-card p { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .terminal-gap { margin-top: 8px !important; }
  .prompt { padding-right: 8px; color: #a8c1ad; }
  .notes-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 72px; padding-block: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .notes-section h2 { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .note-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; margin-top: 17px; }
  .data-note { padding: 18px 20px; border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); background: var(--paper-raised); }
  .data-note h3 { margin: 0 0 7px; }
  .data-caution { margin-top: 12px !important; padding-top: 11px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .site-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding-block: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--faint); font: 11px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .site-footer div { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
  .site-footer a { font: inherit; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-nav, .page-content, .site-footer { width: min(100% - 36px, 600px); }
    .site-nav { min-height: 64px; gap: 12px; }
    .site-nav nav { display: none; }
    .nav-actions { gap: 14px; margin-left: auto; }
    .page-content { padding-block: 48px 58px; }
    .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 34px; padding-bottom: 48px; }
    h1 { max-width: 580px; font-size: clamp(40px, 12vw, 58px); }
    .lede { font-size: 16px; }
    .details-section, .quickstart-section, .notes-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .details-section { padding-block: 34px 40px; }
    .quickstart-section, .notes-section { padding-block: 38px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .site-nav, .page-content, .site-footer { width: calc(100% - 28px); }
    .wordmark { gap: 7px; }
    .nav-actions { gap: 10px; }
    .text-link { font-size: 12px; }
    .site-footer { flex-direction: column; }
    .site-footer div { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .requirements { max-width: 280px; }
  }
</style>
